    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"O projektu\"\ndate: last-modified\ncategories: [\"Ciljevi\", \"Otvorena znanost\", \"Suradnja\"]\n---\n\n\n\n## Ciljevi projekta\n\nCilj nam je sustavno i empirijski istražiti digitalnu prisutnost katoličke tematike u Hrvatskoj. To ćemo postići kroz četiri cilja:\n\n<div class=\"card-grid\">\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n<div class=\"info-card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-broadcast\"></i></div>\n<h4>Prikupljanje podataka</h4>\n<p>Automatizirano prikupljanje medijskih objava u realnom vremenu, koristeći alate za <em>web scraping</em> i API integracije.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n<div class=\"info-card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-database\"></i></div>\n<h4>Baza podataka</h4>\n<p>Stvaranje strukturiranoga korpusa s javnim manifestom, agregatima, kodom i metodologijom, uz kontroliran pristup retcima koji sadrže puni tekst.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n<div class=\"info-card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-cpu\"></i></div>\n<h4>Računalna analiza</h4>\n<p>Primjena računalnih tehnika (obrada prirodnog jezika, strojno učenje) za otkrivanje obrazaca, trendova i narativa u prikupljenim podacima.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n<div class=\"info-card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-share\"></i></div>\n<h4>Dijeljenje rezultata</h4>\n<p>Dijeljenje rezultata kroz znanstvene publikacije, konferencije i radionice, uz objavu koda i metodologije na otvorenim repozitorijima.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## Istraživačka pitanja\n\nProjekt je organiziran oko jednog temeljnog i četiri izvedena istraživačka pitanja koja usmjeravaju prikupljanje i analizu korpusa.\n\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #0f4c5c; border-radius: 10px; padding: 28px 30px; display: flex; gap: 18px; margin: 1.5rem 0 18px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; color: #0f4c5c; padding-top: 3px; flex: none;\">Q1</div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px; color: #14181d; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 500;\">Kako se katolička tematika prikazuje i kako se o njoj raspravlja u digitalnom medijskom prostoru?</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"card-grid\">\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 26px; display: flex; gap: 18px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; color: #0f4c5c; padding-top: 3px;\">Q2</div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #2c3036; line-height: 1.5;\">Kakve su veze između katoličkih tema i drugih društvenih i političkih pitanja?</p></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 26px; display: flex; gap: 18px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; color: #0f4c5c; padding-top: 3px;\">Q3</div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #2c3036; line-height: 1.5;\">Koji su akteri i institucije najistaknutiji u tim raspravama?</p></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 26px; display: flex; gap: 18px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; color: #0f4c5c; padding-top: 3px;\">Q4</div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #2c3036; line-height: 1.5;\">Kako se narativi i tonalitet mijenjaju ovisno o aktualnim događajima?</p></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 26px; display: flex; gap: 18px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; color: #0f4c5c; padding-top: 3px;\">Q5</div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #2c3036; line-height: 1.5;\">Kakva je mrežna dinamika između različitih platformi i medija koji obrađuju ove teme?</p></div>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## Od medijske objave do analize\n\nPodaci se prikupljaju u akumulator, iz njega se jedinstvenim pravilom izrezuje službeni korpus, a zatim se obrađuju i čitaju kroz četiri analitičke razine te peti, vremenski presjek. Dovršena tematska istraživanja ostaju na verzioniranim ulazima na kojima su objavljena.\n\n<div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 56px; margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 19px; top: 22px; bottom: 22px; width: 2px; background: linear-gradient(#0f4c5c, #cfddE1);\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 24px; align-items: start; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 26px; margin-bottom: 18px;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; left: -56px; top: 22px; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0f4c5c; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;\">01</div><div><h3 style=\"font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 21px; margin: 0 0 3px; color: #14181d;\">Prikupljanje</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #4f535a; font-size: 15px; max-width: 62ch;\">Medijske objave s portala, društvenih platformi i foruma pristižu kao tablice — svaki redak jedna objava, s tekstom, izvorom, datumom i pokazateljima dosega i angažmana.</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11.5px;\"><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">xlsx</span><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">ingest</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 24px; align-items: start; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 26px; margin-bottom: 18px;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; left: -56px; top: 22px; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1a5b6b; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;\">02</div><div><h3 style=\"font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 21px; margin: 0 0 3px; color: #14181d;\">Filtriranje</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #4f535a; font-size: 15px; max-width: 62ch;\">Objava najprije mora unutar prvih 3.000 znakova pogoditi najmanje jedan odlučan i dva različita pojma iz popisa od 119, a zatim dosegnuti ocjenu ansambla od najmanje 0,70. Isto pravilo vrijedi za cijelo razdoblje.</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11.5px;\"><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">≥1 odlučan · ≥2 ukupno</span><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">model ≥0,70</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 24px; align-items: start; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 26px; margin-bottom: 18px;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; left: -56px; top: 22px; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2c6f7e; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;\">03</div><div><h3 style=\"font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 21px; margin: 0 0 3px; color: #14181d;\">Službeni korpus</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #4f535a; font-size: 15px; max-width: 62ch;\">Akumulator zadržava sve što je servis isporučio. Iz njega je izveden službeni korpus od 413.985 objava i 54 stupca, na kojem se grade žive stranice, mape i javni agregati. Dovršena tematska istraživanja nisu prebačena na novi ulaz.</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11.5px;\"><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">413.985 × 54</span><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">manifest + provenance</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 24px; align-items: start; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 26px; margin-bottom: 18px;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; left: -56px; top: 22px; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3f8694; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;\">04</div><div><h3 style=\"font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 21px; margin: 0 0 3px; color: #14181d;\">Obrada</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #4f535a; font-size: 15px; max-width: 62ch;\">Iz glavnog skupa izračunavaju se agregati po godini i platformi, a tekst se jezično obrađuje (tokenizacija i lematizacija) kako bi bio spreman za analizu.</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11.5px;\"><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">aggregate</span><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">udpipe</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 24px; align-items: start; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 26px;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; left: -56px; top: 22px; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5a949f; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;\">05</div><div><h3 style=\"font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 21px; margin: 0 0 3px; color: #14181d;\">Analiza</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #4f535a; font-size: 15px; max-width: 62ch;\">Službeni korpus čita se kroz četiri analitičke razine: mapu ekosustava, tematske struje, atmosferu diskursa i fokus na događaje. Peti prikaz daje vremenski presjek evolucije ekosustava, uz ogradu zbog promjene prikupljanja 2024.</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11.5px;\"><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">ecosystem</span><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">themes</span><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">discourse</span><span style=\"background: #eaf0f2; color: #2c5663; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 4px;\">events + time</span></div></div>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## Doprinos i vrijednost projekta\n\nProjekt donosi vrijednost na dvije razine — razvoj vještina sudionika i praksu otvorene znanosti.\n\n### Razvoj vještina\n\nSudionici projekta imat će priliku raditi s najnovijim računalnim tehnikama i alatima. Kroz praktičan rad, razvijat će vještine u analizi velikih količina podataka (Big Data), rudarenju teksta (Text Mining) i statističkom modeliranju.\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"tag tag-primary\">Big Data</span>\n  <span class=\"tag tag-primary\">Text Mining</span>\n  <span class=\"tag tag-primary\">Statističko modeliranje</span>\n  <span class=\"tag tag-primary\">R</span>\n  <span class=\"tag tag-primary\">Python</span>\n  <span class=\"tag\">NLP</span>\n  <span class=\"tag\">Strojno učenje</span>\n  <span class=\"tag\">Mrežna analiza</span>\n</p>\n\n### Otvorena znanost na djelu\n\nPosebna vrijednost projekta leži u njegovoj predanosti principima otvorenosti i transparentnosti. Naš rad temelji se na principima [otvorene znanosti](https://roadworkasia.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Labour_of_Love_An_Open_Access_Manifesto.pdf) i [reproducibilnosti istraživanja](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41562-016-0021).\n\nSvi alati, skripte i metodološki okviri bit će dostupni kao otvoreni kod na **[GitHubu](https://github.com/lusiki/DigiKat)**, omogućujući drugima da provjere, repliciraju i nadograde naš rad.\n\nKroz ovakav pristup potičemo suradnju, jačamo istraživačke profile mladih znanstvenika i doprinosimo otvorenijoj i reproducibilnoj znanstvenoj praksi.\n\n---\n\n## Voditelj projekta\n\nProjekt vodi [doc. dr. sc. Luka Šikić](https://www.lukasikic.info/) (Hrvatsko katoličko sveučilište, Komunikologija), a okuplja interdisciplinarni tim istraživačica i istraživača iz komunikologije, sociologije, statistike, povijesti i odnosa s javnošću.\n\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; max-width: 420px; margin: 1.5rem 0;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">LŠ</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\"><a href=\"https://www.lukasikic.info/\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfccc2;\">doc. dr. sc. Luka Šikić</a></div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Voditelj projekta</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Komunikologija</div></div></div>\n\n<details style=\"margin-top: 18px;\">\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #0f4c5c; font-weight: 600; list-style: none;\">Prikaži suradnice i suradnike <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #8a8e95;\">(9)</span></summary>\n<div class=\"card-grid\" style=\"margin-top: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">AS</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">izv. prof. dr. sc. Andreja Sršen</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">FHS · Sociologija</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">IP</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">izv. prof. dr. sc. Irena Palić</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">EFZG · Statistika</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">LC</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">izv. prof. dr. sc. Lana Ciboci Perša</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Komunikologija</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">PP</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">izv. prof. dr. sc. Petra Palić</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Sociologija</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">IU</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">doc. dr. sc. Ivan Uldrijan</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnik</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Komunikologija</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">SL</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">dr. sc. Suzana Obrovac Lipar</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Odnosi s javnošću</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">HK</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">Hana Kilijan</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Komunikologija</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">VN</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">Veronika Novoselac</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Povijest</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">MT</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">Matea Topić Crnoja</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Sociologija</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</details>\n\n---\n\n## Pridružite se našem istraživanju!\n\nTražimo motivirane istraživače i studente koji žele biti dio inovativnog projekta koji spaja društvene znanosti, podatkovnu analitiku i principe otvorene znanosti. Sudjelovanjem dobivate:\n\n<div class=\"card-grid\">\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n<div class=\"info-card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-graph-up-arrow\"></i></div>\n<h4>Praktično iskustvo</h4>\n<p>Rad s velikim podacima koristeći alate poput <strong>R</strong> i <strong>Python</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n<div class=\"info-card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-diagram-3\"></i></div>\n<h4>Tehničke vještine</h4>\n<p>Obrada prirodnog jezika (NLP), strojno učenje i mrežna analiza.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n<div class=\"info-card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-award\"></i></div>\n<h4>Znanstveni doprinos</h4>\n<p>Rezultati koji su javno dostupni i citirani.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n<div class=\"info-card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-people\"></i></div>\n<h4>Dio inicijative</h4>\n<p>Koja aktivno promiče transparentnost, suradnju i inovacije u znanosti.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
